        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Thief Simulator 2 will transport you to a world full of valuables, expensive cars, and rustling banknotes. As long as you find a way to steal them.\nKnow that a thief's trade is not a piece of cake. In order to get some practice, you'll start with petty theft. This is how you'll gain the experience required to access more and more risky - and most importantly, more profitable - jobs.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Thief Simulator 2 te llevará a un mundo lleno de objetos de valor, coches caros y billetes que crujen, siempre que encuentres la manera de robarlos.\nDebes saber que el oficio de ladrón no es pan comido. Para practicar, empezarás con robos menores. Así es como ganarás la experiencia necesaria para acceder a trabajos cada vez más arriesgados y, lo más importante, más rentables.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2023",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
